			"notes": "Changelog:\n - Updated upstream to [1.12.2](https://github.com/Sollace/Presence-Footsteps/releases/tag/1.12.2%2B1.21.10)\n   - Entity footsteps are no longer blocked when hosting LAN. https://github.com/Sollace/Presence-Footsteps/issues/387\nThis is because some users were reporting entities not producing footsteps when playing on multiplayer games hosted by someone with Presence Footsteps whilst they themselves don't have the mod. It also brings the experience more in line with what you can expect when playing on a multiplayer server as they, too, cannot block server-side entity footsteps.\n   - Fixed compatibility with mods that do client-side things with player motion data (CPM) https://github.com/Sollace/Presence-Footsteps/issues/391\n   - Fixed footsteps playing from other players in multiplayer. https://github.com/Sollace/Presence-Footsteps/issues/387\n     The function that was supposed to block these wasn't actually blocking these, so now it does!\n     - Server-side sounds for regular block steps played by other players are now blocked too\n     - Server-side sounds are also blocked whilst the game is paused! Before they weren't and that was annoying.\n - Fixed stance not being chosen correctly for some mobs\n - Fixed some configuration values being saved and overwritten to the file-system multiple times when modified at the configuration screen"
		},
